msgstr "For ``INDIVIDUAL``, move ``ogrn`` to ``psrnsp``"

#: ../../integration/dadata/settings.rst:342
msgid "ОПФ"
msgstr "Legal form"

#: ../../integration/dadata/settings.rst:343
msgid ""
"Найти запись справочника ``legal-form`` по ``opfCode`` и проставить "
"``legalForm`` — после того как в справочник добавят коды ОКОПФ"
msgstr ""
"Find the ``legal-form`` reference book record by ``opfCode`` and set "
